-    /**
-     * Returns whether the specified {@code ch} conforms to the XML 1.0 definition of whitespace. Refer to
-     * <a href="http://www.w3.org/TR/1998/REC-xml-19980210#NT-S"> the definition of <CODE>S</CODE></a> for details.
-     *
